      ],
      "en": "He shall dwell with you, among you, in the place which he shall choose within one of your gates, where it pleases him best. You shall not oppress him.",
      "ko": "그가 너의 성읍 중에서 기뻐하는 곳을 택하는대로 너와 함께 네 가운데 거하게 하고 그를 압제하지 말찌니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b2a9be7735b4be38a08b592ee4de696a176a75dbe3c13f5b5768df0c8c5be5f0",
      "translation_text_hash": "fd0bc8c1ab00fc335007077806fcbd078a0f6dd60421e4401269196e877a3d8c",
